research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/lem-compact-uniform-spaces-are-complete.md:449:[L1] A cluster point meets every filter member in every neighbourhood, while convergence means containment of every neighbourhood ([[def-filter-convergence-and-cluster-point]]).
