research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/lem-compact-uniform-spaces-are-complete.md-451-[L2] Cauchy filters have small members, and symmetric entourages have symmetric square roots ([[def-cauchy-filter-in-a-uniform-space]], [[lem-symmetric-entourages-form-a-base]]).
research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/lem-compact-uniform-spaces-are-complete.md-452-
research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/lem-compact-uniform-spaces-are-complete.md-453-[L3] For the topology induced by a uniformity, every entourage ball $D[x]$ is a neighbourhood of $x$ ([[thm-uniformity-induces-a-topology]]).
